                                                "example_id": "dd753962-267c-41fd-83e6-891c012a38f1",
                                                "sense_id": "48a14fe7-11f6-3c75-9de5-5577fb142b2d",
                                                "text": "The most remarkable of all the attendants of the exhibition at the grove near Rockville, was the grace and loveliness of the young beauties, who, mingling with the crowd of farmers, were all intent and gazing upon the stock and other agricultural products, unconscious that they were themselves ‘the observed of all observers;’ […]"
                                            },
